RTGT-1#1 Advisory
RAM retargeting possibility  
Identified 12 RAM32X1D primitives that could be retargeted to RAM32M. Retargeting will save approximately 4 memory LUTs and improve routability. These can usually be achieved using synthesis inference or XPMs. The memories are cpu_mid/addr_trans/tlb_entry/tlb_d0_reg_r2_0_31_0_0,
cpu_mid/addr_trans/tlb_entry/tlb_d1_reg_r2_0_31_0_0,
cpu_mid/addr_trans/tlb_entry/tlb_mat0_reg_r2_0_31_0_0,
cpu_mid/addr_trans/tlb_entry/tlb_mat0_reg_r2_0_31_1_1,
